# Large data files served from public/ at runtime (copies of src/data/)
# search_index.json + doc_links.json + segment_index.json deliberately
# tracked: needed by the live tutor's keyword + segment search, no
# build-time pipeline copies them into dist/.
# transcript_segments.json (59MB) stays blocked — only used by Guided
# Player pages, not the tutor. video_library_enriched.json is copied
# from content/ by the prebuild script so it doesn't need tracking here.
path-builder/public/data/transcript_segments.json
path-builder/public/data/video_library_enriched.json
